cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Thermal Transmittance Workflows"
message: "If you use this repository, please cite it as below."
type: software

authors:
  - family-names: Fontanella
    given-names: Luca
    email: luca.fontanella@gmail.com
    affiliation: "Università Iuav di Venezia"

repository-code: "https://github.com/lfontanella/thermal-transmittance-workflows"

abstract: >
  Proprietary and open-source workflows for BIM/openBIM-based thermal
  transmittance requirement analysis. The repository documents a Revit/Dynamo
  proprietary workflow and an IDS/Python/JSON open-source workflow developed
  as part of a PhD research project on BIM, openBIM and thermal performance
  analysis.

keywords:
  - BIM
  - openBIM
  - IFC
  - IDS
  - Python
  - Dynamo
  - Revit
  - thermal transmittance
  - building performance
  - energy performance
  - regulatory requirements

